From: Banks Troutman <banks.troutman@oxos.com>
Date: Mon, 09 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: tegra: enable DPCM on codec-to-codec links

Set no_pcm, dpcm_playback, dpcm_capture on C2C dai-links so the
ASoC core opens the BE stream. Without this, external codecs on
C2C links never get hw_params and I2S clocks never start.

Also call canonicalize_dailink to propagate dai_fmt and set
ignore_pmdown_time to match PCM_LINK behavior.

---
--- a/nvidia/sound/soc/tegra-alt/utils/tegra_asoc_dt_parser.c
+++ b/nvidia/sound/soc/tegra-alt/utils/tegra_asoc_dt_parser.c
@@ -387,6 +387,11 @@
 				break;
 			case C2C_LINK:
 				dai_link->params = &link_params;
+				dai_link->no_pcm = 1;
+				dai_link->dpcm_playback = 1;
+				dai_link->dpcm_capture = 1;
+				asoc_simple_card_canonicalize_dailink(dai_link);
+				dai_link->ignore_pmdown_time = 1;
 				break;
 			default:
 				dev_err(&pdev->dev, "DAI link type invalid\n");
